This product is a plugin for DeepSeek Harness
(https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness). It links against DeepSeek
Harness packages as peer dependencies; no DeepSeek Harness source is included.

No font file is redistributed with this plugin. A face is a package name and a
pinned version; the Host downloads its stylesheets and shards from the npm
registries configured in `mirrors` and caches them on the machine it runs on.
The fonts reachable this way keep their own licenses:

- Noto Sans SC, Noto Serif SC, Ma Shan Zheng, ZCOOL XiaoWei, ZCOOL KuaiLe,
  ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou, Zhi Mang Xing, Long Cang, Liu Jian Mao Cao, Inter,
  Geist, JetBrains Mono, Fira Code, Geist Mono, Noto Sans Mono and Maple Mono CN
  — SIL Open Font License 1.1, packaged by Fontsource or by the font's own
  publisher.
- LXGW WenKai, LXGW WenKai TC and LXGW WenKai Screen — SIL Open Font License
  1.1; the npm packages that carry them, `lxgw-wenkai-webfont`,
  `lxgw-wenkai-tc-webfont` and `lxgw-wenkai-screen-webfont`, are MIT.
